 * ODIN template preview drawer (#1723 Story 3, Task 10/11). A second Radix
 * dialog layer stacked OVER the still-mounted `templatePickerDialog()`. Its
 * accessible name comes from `Drawer.Title`, which renders the clicked
 * card's `template.name` verbatim (e.g. "Atropia") — so, like
 * `odinTemplateCard`, this takes the name as a parameter rather than a
 * fixed string.
